(CATAN - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Overview) Tj T*
(Players are settlers on an island. They collect resources, build roads,) Tj T*
(settlements and cities, and race to 10 victory points.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Components) Tj T*
(19 terrain hexes, 6 sea frames, 18 number tokens, 95 resource cards) Tj T*
(\(brick, lumber, wool, grain, ore\), 25 development cards and 1 robber.) Tj T*
(Each player has 5 settlements, 4 cities and 15 roads of one color.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Setup) Tj T*
(Build the island with the terrain hexes and place a number token on each,) Tj T*
(except the desert. The robber starts on the desert.) Tj T*
(Each player places 2 settlements and 2 roads. The second settlement) Tj T*
(immediately gives one resource for every terrain hex next to it.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
