(Turn Overview) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(On your turn you do three things in this order:) Tj T*
(1. Roll both dice. Every hex with that number produces resources for all) Tj T*
(   players with a settlement \(1 card\) or a city \(2 cards\) on its corners.) Tj T*
(2. Trade with other players or with the bank.) Tj T*
(3. Build roads, settlements, cities or buy development cards.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Trading) Tj T*
(You may trade resources with other players only during your own turn.) Tj T*
(With the bank you can always trade 4 identical resources for 1 of your choice.) Tj T*
(A settlement on a harbor improves this rate to 3:1, or 2:1 for one resource.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Building costs) Tj T*
(Road: 1 brick + 1 lumber.) Tj T*
(Settlement: 1 brick + 1 lumber + 1 wool + 1 grain.) Tj T*
(City \(upgrade of a settlement\): 3 ore + 2 grain.) Tj T*
(Development card: 1 ore + 1 wool + 1 grain.) Tj T*
(Settlements must be at least two corners away from any other settlement.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
