/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
56 780 Td
(Rolling a 7 and the Robber) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(When a 7 is rolled, no hex produces resources.) Tj T*
(Every player holding more than 7 resource cards must discard half of them,) Tj T*
(rounded down.) Tj T*
(Then the player who rolled moves the robber to any other hex and steals) Tj T*
(1 random resource card from a player with a settlement or city on that hex.) Tj T*
(A hex with the robber does not produce resources until the robber leaves.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Development cards) Tj T*
(Knight: move the robber and steal 1 card.) Tj T*
(Progress cards: Road Building, Year of Plenty and Monopoly.) Tj T*
(Victory Point cards stay hidden until you win.) Tj T*
(You may play only one development card per turn, and not on the turn you) Tj T*
(bought it \(Victory Point cards excepted\).) Tj T*
ET
endstream
