(Winning the Game) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The first player who has 10 or more victory points on their own turn wins.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Victory points) Tj T*
(Settlement: 1 point. City: 2 points.) Tj T*
(Longest Road \(at least 5 connected roads\): 2 points.) Tj T*
(Largest Army \(at least 3 Knights played\): 2 points.) Tj T*
(Each Victory Point development card: 1 point.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Game length) Tj T*
(A game takes about 60 to 90 minutes with 3 or 4 players.) Tj T*
ET
